    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GrandFather\u2019s Bakery places the player in charge of reviving an old stone bakery founded decades ago in a small town. Inheriting the bakery from their grandfather, the player is responsible for restoring the business to its former glory while also paying off lingering debts from the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game combines elements of resource management, production planning, and customer relations. Players must source essential ingredients such as flour, yeast, and water, follow recipes accurately, and optimize bakery operations to meet daily sales targets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success depends on crafting smart strategies to manage costs, maintain high customer satisfaction, and build the bakery\u2019s reputation. The ultimate goal is to transform this legendary stone bakery, built by the grandfather\u2019s hands, back into the pride of the town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GrandFather\u2019s Bakery places the player in charge of reviving an old stone bakery founded decades ago in a small town. Inheriting the bakery from their grandfather, the player is responsible for restoring the business to its former glory while also paying off lingering debts from the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game combines elements of resource management, production planning, and customer relations. Players must source essential ingredients such as flour, yeast, and water, follow recipes accurately, and optimize bakery operations to meet daily sales targets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success depends on crafting smart strategies to manage costs, maintain high customer satisfaction, and build the bakery\u2019s reputation. The ultimate goal is to transform this legendary stone bakery, built by the grandfather\u2019s hands, back into the pride of the town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
